## Listening to Streamed Text

Use this to handle chunked text as it arrives from the server.

```javascript
client.addEventListener('message', e => {
  const { data, stream } = e.detail;
  if (stream) console.log('Chunk:', data);
  else console.log('Final:', data);
});
```

### Notes
- Only works for text mode.
- Automatic cleanup occurs when `[DONE]` is received.

## Configure Image Client

```javascript
client.setTimeout(30000);
client.setRetry(true, 2, 1000);
client.setSeed(12345);
```

### Notes
- Timeout limits request duration.
- Retry auto-retries failed requests.
- Seed ensures reproducible output.
